Hello there! 👋

<br/>

It's the final countdown to the New Year! 🎉 I wanted to finish this 2024 with additional commits to the Business Card project. I was able to add two new versions that you can use. The inspiration came from browsing the internet and articles related to the topic 😊.

<br/>

👉 You can find it [here](https://github.com/MSpiechowicz/business-card-style-website).

